     "id": "6d89400",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<ul class=\"d2u-list\"><li><strong>Product</strong><br>Design and create innovative product prototypes such as bottles and packaging, combining functionality with aesthetic appeal.</li><li><strong>Structural</strong><br>Craft functional and visually appealing furniture designs, focusing on structure, stability, and creativity.</li><li><strong>Humanoid</strong><br>Explore the art of human body sculpting by designing detailed and lifelike humanoid models.</li><li><strong>Automotive</strong><br>Design functional automotive parts with precision, emphasizing performance and practicality.</li><li><strong>Building Your First Printer</strong><br>General knowledge of how a 3D printer works and how to print at production quality.</li></ul>"
     },
